  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase" ADogSaidBody="LegsTail">
    <defName>RSW_Taozin</defName>
    <label>taozin</label>
    <description>The Taozin (also known as a 'force dragon') was a giant predatory annelid with many arms and legs native to the jungle moon of Va'art. Finding their way all over the galaxy, Taozin were thought to be extinct but this may in fact be due to their highly elusive nature. They produce an rare curiosity from their skin when butchered known as a 'Taozin nodule'.</description>
